    "description": "Title\n: Hemingray Whitall Tatum Collectible Insulator Lot Glass Power Line Hardware Mixed Condition\nOptional title\n: Lot of Vintage Glass Insulators & Spool Collectibles\nBrand\n: Hemingray, Whitall Tatum\nModel\n: 16, 20, 45, No.1\nColor\n: Clear, Aqua Blue\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nType\n: A\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Enhance your collection with this unique lot featuring six vintage glass insulators and an antique wooden spool. The insulators are from renowned brands like Hemingray and Whitall Tatum, featuring clear and aqua blue glass, with embossed markings that testify to their historical value and craftsmanship. Each piece boasts its own aged patina, adding to the authentic, industrial charm collectors seek. The included wooden spool, with metal and ceramic accents, complements the glass insulators perfectly as a display or conversation piece. These items not only offer visual appeal but also represent a piece of telecommunications and utility history, making them ideal for display in homes or offices. All items are authentic vintage and show minor wear consistent with age, ensuring you receive original, quality collectibles. Perfect for enthusiasts or as unique decoradd these pieces to your collection with confidence.\nA A\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
